# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""KHUON node bieu thuc: (kind, o) -> KIEU cua o.

DA CHUYEN VAO `compiler/` (2026-09-18, phep lat): bay gio `expr_row` DOC
bang nay LUC CHAY de ma hoa/giai ma tung o, nen no la mot phan cua compiler
chu khong con la du lieu cho cong cu nua.

Vi sao can bang nay. Buoc B1 tach `ea/eb/ec` da kieu thanh cac accessor CO
KIEU (`ea_str`, `ea_nut`, `ea_ds`, ...), vi TokenVector doi DUNG MOT kieu
tra ve cho moi ham. Tach duoc la nho mot su that do duoc:

    (kind, o) -> kieu la MOT HAM - khong o nao da kieu giua cac kind.

Do ngay 2026-09-18 bang cach boc `mk2/mk3/mk4` roi bien dich ca kho mau
(test/ + tools/ + ca cay tu-host `release/3.code`): 54 cap (kind, o) quan
sat duoc, moi cap dung mot kieu. Hai kind khong xuat hien trong kho
(`await`, `shape`) suy tu chinh cho dung trong `il_core.py` - co ghi chu.

NAM KIEU O:
    'str'     chuoi (ten bien, toan tu, van ban so, ten method)
    'nut'     mot node con
    'ds'      danh sach node (co the RONG)
    'ds_str'  danh sach chuoi - CHI `lambda` o1
    'i32'     so nguyen      - CHI `shape` o2

`slice` o2/o3 co the VANG (None, 15 lan trong kho). Khi lat sang pool,
dung sentinel giong `stmt_row.ABSENT` chu khong phai None.
"""

# (kind, chi so o) -> kieu. Chi so o tinh SAU o loai: 1, 2, 3.
KHUON: "dict[str,str]" = {
    # --- node KHONG o (arity 1) ---
    # `('null',)` - `None` trong nguon. Khong o nao nen khong co muc ':1'.
    # --- la: mot o van ban ---
    'var:1': 'str',
    'num:1': 'str',
    'str_lit:1': 'str',
    'bytes_lit:1': 'str',
    # --- mot o node ---
    'neg:1': 'nut',
    'not:1': 'nut',
    'await:1': 'nut',        # il_core.py: mk2('await', self.parse_factor())
    # --- danh sach node ---
    'list_literal:1': 'ds',
    'tuple_lit:1': 'ds',        # (2026-09-25) '(a, b)' bieu thuc
    'dict_lit:1': 'ds',         # (2026-09-26) '{k: v, ...}' - khoa/gia tri xen ke
    # --- goi / chi so theo TEN ---
    'call:1': 'str', 'call:2': 'ds',
    'index:1': 'str', 'index:2': 'ds',
    'attr:1': 'str', 'attr:2': 'str',
    'method_call:1': 'str', 'method_call:2': 'str', 'method_call:3': 'ds',
    # --- goi / chi so tren BIEU THUC ---
    'index_expr:1': 'nut', 'index_expr:2': 'nut',
    'attr_expr:1': 'nut', 'attr_expr:2': 'str',
    'method_call_expr:1': 'nut', 'method_call_expr:2': 'str',
    'method_call_expr:3': 'ds',
    'index_call:1': 'nut', 'index_call:2': 'ds',
    # --- toan tu ---
    'binop:1': 'str', 'binop:2': 'nut', 'binop:3': 'nut',
    'compare:1': 'str', 'compare:2': 'nut', 'compare:3': 'nut',
    'boolop:1': 'str', 'boolop:2': 'nut', 'boolop:3': 'nut',
    'ternary:1': 'nut', 'ternary:2': 'nut', 'ternary:3': 'nut',
    'in:1': 'nut', 'in:2': 'nut',
    # `slice` o2/o3 CO THE VANG - xem docstring.
    'slice:1': 'str', 'slice:2': 'nut', 'slice:3': 'nut',
    # --- khac ---
    'kwarg:1': 'str', 'kwarg:2': 'nut',
    'star:1': 'nut',
    'star2:1': 'nut',
    'walrus:1': 'str', 'walrus:2': 'nut',
    'lambda:1': 'ds_str',    # il_core.py: params la danh sach TEN
    'lambda:2': 'nut',
    'shape:1': 'str',
    'shape:2': 'i32',        # il_core.py: mk3('shape', v, int(v4))
}
